  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>NiftyCarts</strong></span><br>是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/astikorcarts\" rel=\"nofollow\">AstikorCarts</a> 模組的 Fabric 移植版。</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>連結</strong></span><br>- 本專案：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fniftycarts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 與 <a href=\"https://github.com/jmb05/nifty-carts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github</a><br>- AstikorCarts（Forge 1.12.2、1.16.4/5、1.18.2、1.19.2）：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/astikorcarts\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a><br>- AstikorCarts Redux（Forge 1.19.4-1.20.1）：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fastikorcarts-redux\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/astikor-carts-redux\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>車輛</strong></span></p><p>此模組新增三種不同的車輛：</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>補給車</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/CXd6g9xp/images/6893627cf0b30eaa37e3f5e1752e40f8bd7b6a46.gif\" alt=\"補給車動圖\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\"></p><p>- 雙倍箱子的儲物空間<br>- 後方一個座位</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>犁</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/CXd6g9xp/images/e56a6022ae274cb7bb713ad157032e9031c16fc5.gif\" alt=\"犁動圖\" width=\"700\" height=\"700\"></p><p>- 可放置3個工具（鋤頭、鏟子、斧頭）<br>- 對下方的方塊使用這些工具（耕地、鋪設路徑、剝樹皮）</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>動物車</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/CXd6g9xp/images/5bd43402b8842303d1c65493b2af3f290c8c7009.gif\" alt=\"動物車動圖\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\"></p><p>- 兩個座位，可供玩家或生物乘坐</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>使用方法</strong></span></p><p>按下「動作鍵」（預設為 R）可連接或斷開附近車輛與你騎乘的生物。按一次衝刺鍵可切換「慢速模式」，讓你的坐騎和車輛移動更慢。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>模組展示（由 Zeddy Minecraft 製作）</strong></span></p><p><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/suTj01lAFOk\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>輪子</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/CXd6g9xp/images/e93733ad927acfe08e23fa02432930ad4bc89a1f.png\" alt=\"輪子合成配方\" width=\"472\" height=\"224\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>補給車</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/CXd6g9xp/images/23560032e7e8db0017c2e7f590d96f623ed009ce.png\" alt=\"補給車合成配方\" width=\"472\" height=\"224\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>犁</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/CXd6g9xp/images/a3586b5eb22a4a8819bf8ed50f20a91eb9448d04.png\" alt=\"動物車合成配方\" width=\"472\" height=\"224\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>動物車</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/CXd6g9xp/images/de8ca4369830fe55dba0cfc28d11227fbec5781c.png\" alt=\"犁合成配方\" width=\"472\" height=\"224\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>手推車</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/CXd6g9xp/images/1fe51705ccc0a4b8d8cc46a251f692745bddfc9d.webp\" alt=\"手推車合成配方\" width=\"472\" height=\"224\"></p>\n</div>",
